<title>USA: Network to redeem common stock warrants.</title>
<headline>Network to redeem common stock warrants.</headline>
<dateline>ALPHARETTA, Ga. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Network Connection Inc said Tuesday it will redeem in whole its redeemable common stock purchase warrants on April 30, for the price of $0.25 per warrant.</p>
<p>The date for redemption was extended from March 31 to give warrantholders more time to exercise their warrants, the company said.</p>
